  "prefLabel": "Ins 1406.18 Claim Reserves",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1406.18 Claim Reserves. Each member shall maintain claim reserving procedures for claims arising out of facility business commensurate with the procedures utilized by the members for claims arising out of non-facility business.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Ins 1400) #13162, eff 1-25-21; ss by #13534, eff 1-24-23",
